{%- comment -%}
  ELSORA mobile menu drawer finish (round 15). Rendered as the first child of
  #menu-drawer in snippets/header-drawer.liquid.

  On every page that uses the ELSORA header (round 15c; it used to be only
  the sandbox page, product.ice-globes and /cart), only below 990px (where the hamburger drawer is used; desktop uses the
  dropdown menu and is unchanged).
  - Background: snippets/elsora-wave-bg.liquid (same wave ribbons) with the
    hero's light-aqua colours (no grey areas); the bottom fades into white
    (round 15b). Just below the panel a SHORT white fade (22px, round 15d)
    hides the edge; the 64px version from 15b washed out the purple hero
    eyebrow, so keep it short. Plus the background finish layers (grain + satin sheen) from
    snippets/elsora-bg-finish.liquid via var(--elsora-finish-wave*).
  - Items: dark text, no grey highlight; hover/focus = soft translucent
    white, active item = thin lavender underline.
  - Header (X, logo, cart) and the open/close behaviour are not touched.
{%- endcomment -%}
  {%- render 'elsora-wave-bg' -%}
  <style>
    #menu-drawer > .elsora-wave-bg { display: none; }
    @media screen and (max-width: 989px) {
      #menu-drawer.menu-drawer {
        background: #FFFFFF;
        isolation: isolate;
        overflow: visible;
      }
      #menu-drawer.menu-drawer::after {
        content: '';
        position: absolute;
        left: 0;
        right: 0;
        top: 100%;
        height: 22px;
        background: linear-gradient(180deg, #FFFFFF 0%, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5) 40%, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0) 100%);
        pointer-events: none;
      }
      #menu-drawer > .elsora-wave-bg {
        display: block;
        background: #A8F0F8;
        background: var(--elsora-finish-wave, none), linear-gradient(
          180deg,
          #F0F8F8 0%, #D0F0F8 12%, #A8F0F8 30%, #78E8F0 52%, #58E8F0 62%, #70E8F0 72%, #A0F0F8 82%, #D8F8F8 92%, #FFFFFF 100%
        );
        background-size: var(--elsora-finish-wave-size, auto);
        background-repeat: var(--elsora-finish-wave-repeat, repeat);
        background-blend-mode: var(--elsora-finish-wave-blend, normal);
      }
      #menu-drawer > .elsora-wave-bg .elsora-wave-bg__top-fade { display: none; }
      #menu-drawer .menu-drawer__utility-links { background-color: transparent; }
      #menu-drawer .menu-drawer__menu-item,
      #menu-drawer .menu-drawer__account {
        color: #0D0D0D;
        background-color: transparent;
      }
      #menu-drawer .menu-drawer__menu-item:hover,
      #menu-drawer .menu-drawer__menu-item:focus,
      #menu-drawer .menu-drawer__menu-item--active:hover {
        color: #0D0D0D;
        background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.32);
      }
      #menu-drawer .menu-drawer__menu-item--active {
        text-decoration: underline;
        text-decoration-color: #706FCB;
        text-decoration-thickness: 1px;
        text-underline-offset: 6px;
      }
    }
  </style>
